WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.054
Welcome to BhuVerify, a reading aid for property
documents.

2
00:00:04.375 --> 00:00:09.296
These illustrations use fictional records. No official
verification is performed.

3
00:00:09.625 --> 00:00:12.212
Choose Explore a sample case to learn safely.

4
00:00:12.542 --> 00:00:15.715
Or choose New property case to begin with your own
document.

5
00:00:16.042 --> 00:00:23.563
Choose Add document. Supported formats are PDF, PNG,
JPG, and TXT, up to ten megabytes.

6
00:00:23.917 --> 00:00:29.298
Upload only with permission. Redact sensitive details,
and read the consent notice first.

7
00:00:29.625 --> 00:00:33.813
In Review fields, compare each extracted value with the
source document.

8
00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:38.371
Fix mistakes, check the quoted evidence, and save your
corrections.

9
00:00:38.708 --> 00:00:42.062
Choose Run document checks, then read each explanation.

10
00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:44.420
Needs attention means review is needed.

11
00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:48.716
Not established means evidence is missing or official
checks are unavailable.

12
00:00:49.042 --> 00:00:51.498
Neither proves fraud or verifies legal title.

13
00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:56.169
Open Bihar services for official next steps outside
BhuVerify.

14
00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:01.792
These links open external services. BhuVerify has not
checked their live records.

15
00:01:02.125 --> 00:01:07.134
Open Reading settings to adjust text size, high
contrast, and reduced motion.

16
00:01:07.458 --> 00:01:12.215
English and Hindi captions, and a written transcript,
help you follow this video.

17
00:01:12.542 --> 00:01:15.126
Return to How it works whenever you need guidance.

18
00:01:15.458 --> 00:01:22.306
Keep original documents, verify through official
sources, and seek qualified advice before a property
decision.
